  "limitations": [
    "Evaluated on US Walmart benchmark data; not calibrated to your store.",
    "The benchmark is the M5 data set: food, household and hobby products in 10 Walmart stores in California, Texas and Wisconsin. The one-time check used 7- and 28-day windows from November 2015 to May 2016.",
    "This is a one-sided upper estimate of demand, not a range: there is no lower estimate. It is not a guarantee and not an order quantity.",
    "In the benchmark it was checked only as \"actual sales at or below the estimate\"; how often that holds for your products can differ (other prices, promotions, customers or stock-outs).",
    "Sales recorded while out of stock understate demand, so the estimate can be low for products that often run out.",
    "Your reorder suggestions and your safety stock do not use this estimate."
